  Reference copies use a text extension and are excluded from runtime imports.
  superagent/dsh/src/client/settings-shell.js adapts the settings slot and
  dialog composition from ds-bot/src/client/settings-shell.js.
  superagent/dsh/src/client/themes.js adapts theme tokens from
  ds-bot/src/client/themes.js. The product shell, palette and notification
  modules adapt ds-bot/src/client/sidebar.js, header.js, overlays.js,
  palette.js, notifications.js, notify.js and feedback.js.
