  styling from ds-bot/src/client/folder-menu.js and model-menu.js.
  Main continuous voice adapts VoiceMode from ds-bot/src/client/voice.js
  and the voice input controls from ds-bot/src/client/composer.js.
  The work role dock uses the member marks and status presentation from
  ds-bot/src/client/member-status.js and mark.js.
